{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5b3424fc-946c-8216-968d-dd62fabcd175",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T12:14:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diane Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:12:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. Happy new year, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, happy new year to you too. Um, I'm calling about property taxes. I need a copy of a paid bill from a past year, for a refinance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Which year are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, it's the one from 2024. The lender wants proof it was paid, so I figured a copy of the bill itself would do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That should work. I can mail you a duplicate. Is it going to the address on the original bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course, same address. Sure, mailing is perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I get your name as it appears on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's Diane Pellegrino. P-E-L-L-E-G-R-I-N-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Do you have a number in case we have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, it's 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:13:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. I'll put in the request for the 2024 bill, marked paid. Should reach you in about a week, give or take the mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:14:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's fine. Honestly there's no rush, the closing's not till spring. I'm hoping to be done in time for a hiking trip I'm planning, so, you know, I'd like it wrapped up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:14:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, we'll do our part so the paperwork doesn't keep you off the trail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:14:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, sure, thank you. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:14:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Diane. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:14:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
